{"id":"646665","name":"沙姜白切肉","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/646665/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"梅花肉","amount":"400g"}],"sub":[{"name":"沙姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"梅花肉一块。","img":"images/646665/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"水开入锅，加入姜片和料酒。","img":"images/646665/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮15分钟，筷子能穿过即熟了。","img":"images/646665/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出放凉。","img":"images/646665/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"沙姜、葱头。","img":"images/646665/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把剁好的沙姜和葱粒放入碗内。","img":"images/646665/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炝入热油。","img":"images/646665/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入酱油调拌即可。","img":"images/646665/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"肉切成片，配上蘸酱。","img":"images/646665/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。简单又好吃。","img":"images/646665/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}